            "body": "I am afraid, there is now way to do that.\r\n\r\n*But*! I now think that adding padding by default might indeed be a better choice. Both for 'mini.pick' and 'mini.files'. I'll take a day or two to make sure that it doesn't cause any bad side effects first and then maybe will add it.",
